    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Required by Medicare's hospital rules:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the outcome of the hospitalization, disposition of the case, and provisions for follow-up care; the final diagnosis is recorded and the record completed within 30 days after discharge."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "The Joint Commission's 6 components:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " 1. reason for hospitalization; 2. significant findings; 3. procedures and treatment provided; 4. the patient's discharge condition; 5. patient and family instructions (medications, diet, physical activity, follow-up care); 6. attending physician's signature."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "National Quality Forum adds:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " a comprehensive, reconciled medication list, and a list of acute issues, tests and studies whose results weren't back at discharge and need follow-up."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Society of Hospital Medicine adds:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " final diagnoses (primary and secondary); discharge destination; follow-up appointments; anticipated problems and suggested interventions; pending labs and tests; subspecialty consultants' recommendations; documentation of patient education."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
